# This example orphan branch addresses a float conversion problem

## Original Project

[Bouncing Ball Example Project by griffpatch_tutor](https://scratch.mit.edu/projects/12185288/editor/)

## File Structure Notes

* `expected/`: Contains a duplicate of `generated/`, edited to solve the float issue.
* `generated/`: Contains goboscript code generated by sb2gs.
* `project.expected.json`: Purely extracted from sb3.
* `project.expected.formatted.json`: Formatted `project.expected.json` using `prettier` and `prettier-plugin-sort-json`.
* `project.generated.json`: Processed from sb3 to gs by sb2gs, and then `tools/run compile` was used to generate `project.json` via goboscript.
* `project.generated.formatted.json`: Formatted `project.generated.json` using `prettier` and `prettier-plugin-sort-json`.
* `LICENSE`: According to the [Scratch wiki](https://web.archive.org/web/20250216161619/en.scratch-wiki.info/wiki/Scratch_Project_License), this project uses CC-BY-SA 4.0, which is a [Compatible License](https://creativecommons.org/share-your-work/licensing-considerations/compatible-licenses/) with CC-BY-SA 2.0.

